<title>SPAIN: Spain's Cubiertas resumes trade today - CNMV.</title>
<headline>Spain's Cubiertas resumes trade today - CNMV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish construction firm Cubiertas y MZOV resumes trade on Monday, the Stock Market Commission CNMV said.</p>
<p>Cubiertas was suspended on Thursday after announcing a merger with construction firm Entrecanales.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
